# Live Hindustan


> Latest Hindi news, breaking updates, and in-depth coverage of politics, business, sports, entertainment, lifestyle, astrology, education, technology, and regional India.


Live Hindustan is the digital news platform of the Hindi newspaper Hindustan. It publishes breaking news, live updates, analysis, videos, photo stories, and service journalism for Hindi-speaking readers in India and worldwide.


## Homepage and Core Sections


- [Live Hindustan](https://www.livehindustan.com/): Main Hindi news destination for breaking stories, live coverage, trending topics, and editor-selected reports.


